1
00:04:43,333 --> 00:04:49,333
When you’re on the lam, they call the ham.

2
00:09:26,666 --> 00:09:32,666
Hitpig! is a animation, comedy, adventure film directed by David Feiss.

3
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:16,000
A porcine bounty hunter accepts his next hit:
Pickles, a naive, ebullient elephant.

4
00:18:53,333 --> 00:18:59,333
Though he initially sets out to capture the perky pachyderm, the unlikely pair find themselves
crisscrossing the globe on an adventure that brings out the best in both of them.

5
00:23:36,666 --> 00:23:42,666
Hitpig (voice), played by Jason Sudeikis.

6
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:26,000
Pickles (voice), played by Lilly Singh.

7
00:33:03,333 --> 00:33:09,333
Leapin' Lord of the Leotard (voice), played by Rainn Wilson.

8
00:37:46,666 --> 00:37:52,666
Leticia dos Anjos (voice), played by Anitta.

9
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:36,000
Koala (voice), played by Hannah Gadsby.

10
00:47:13,333 --> 00:47:19,333
Polecat (voice), played by RuPaul.

11
00:51:56,666 --> 00:52:02,666
is a 2024 animated comedy film directed by Cinzia Angelini and David Feiss.

12
00:56:40,000 --> 00:56:46,000
The film comes from an original story by Berkeley Breathed,
rooted from his 2008 children's book Pete & Pickles.

13
01:01:23,333 --> 01:01:29,333
Breathed also wrote the screenplay alongside Dave Rosenbaum and Tyler Werrin.

14
01:06:06,666 --> 01:06:12,666
Produced by Aniventure and animated by Cinesite, the film features the voices of Jason
Sudeikis, Lilly Singh, Rainn Wilson, Anitta, RuPaul, Hannah Gadsby and Charlie Adler.

15
01:10:50,000 --> 01:10:56,000
was released in North America on 1 November 2024.

16
01:15:33,333 --> 01:15:39,333
The film explores themes of friendship, bounty hunter,
hitman, animal species, futuristic.

17
01:20:16,666 --> 01:20:22,666
The tone is lighthearted.
